&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own Figma&#39;s monetization strategy, leading the development and execution of pricing, packaging, and business model initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive cross-functional decision-making on high-impact strategic opportunities, partnering with executive stakeholders to align on direction and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing team, raising the bar for strategic thinking, analytical rigor, and executive communication&lt;/li&gt;
