&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;12+ years of experience spanning strategy consulting, private equity operations, business operations, product strategy, growth, revenue strategy, or related functions within high-growth technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
