&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Roll up your sleeves on escalated issues to assist the team and create documentation, deploy new systems and processes to effectively scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and maintain dashboards showing relevant helpdesk metrics (CSAT, SLAs, most common issues) to serve as a baseline for end-user support and overall IT performance. As a data-driven leader you&#39;ll use these metrics to identify root causes and create solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proactively identify and address inefficiencies and bottlenecks within IT Operations (e.g. access requests, automations, lifecycle management)&lt;/li&gt;
