&lt;li&gt;Define strategy &amp;amp; roadmap for your team and execute on that roadmap with a high degree of autonomy, velocity, and craftsmanship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on technical leadership to your teams and others that collaborate with your teams to ensure a cohesive product experience and the right technical abstractions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, mentor, and retain high performing engineers (and help with other cross functional roles). You’ll foster a culture of innovation, collaboration and taking calculated risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figma is committed to building an inclusive and diverse team and culture. We expect all of our leaders to play a role in helping to build and drive these initiatives through hiring, community events, and other programs in partnership with teams across all of Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
