&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership skills in building a high-performing and highly engaged engineering team; including mentoring, and growing senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to build and operate fast-moving teams that balance innovation with execution&lt;/li&gt;
