&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll serve as the dedicated People Partner to Figma’s Product Engineering and Data organizations, working closely with the VP, Engineering and VP, Data and their respective leadership teams. You’ll help these organizations scale effectively by strengthening leadership capability, shaping organizational design, and aligning talent strategy to the product strategy. You’ll also collaborate closely with PDE People Partners and other cross-functional partners across the People Team - including Compensation, Recruiting, Learning &amp;amp; Development, BEI, and People Relations - to drive high-impact initiatives that support the holistic Engineering and PDE organizational goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to shape how leadership, performance culture, and talent strategy evolve as Figma’s Product Engineering and Data organizations continue to grow and mature.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time role that can be based in one of our US hubs or remotely within the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do at Figma:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Engineering + Data leadership teams as a trusted advisor, providing strategic guidance on leadership effectiveness, organizational design, and talent strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support continued scaling of the Product Engineering &amp;amp; Data organizations by evolving team structures, roles, and operating models in line with boarder Engineering organizational growth and productivity goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach senior leaders to strengthen leadership capability, team effectiveness, and performance in a high-growth, fast-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Engineering and Data Leadership to evolve performance and compensation frameworks, talent planning, and succession strategies that drive business outcomes and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and address organizational friction points by improving cross-functional alignment and operational clarity across PDE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed as a key partner across cross-functional stakeholders - including other Engineering and regional People Partners, Compensation, Recruiting, Learning &amp;amp; Development, BEI, and People Relations - to drive and deliver high-impact people initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data, organizational insights, and employee feedback to proactively inform decisions and drive measurable improvements in team health, effectiveness, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and drive people strategy in service of Engineering priorities, ensuring alignment with the broader PDE strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
