&lt;li&gt;Help design and deploy an internal service mesh network which can support Figma&#39;s growing portfolio of services and features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop intelligent detection and auto-scaling countermeasures for DDoS threats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug and resolve production issues across services and multiple layers of the stack, reducing mean time to resolution for critical incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
